{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山道1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"It's always so nice and quiet here..."<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Why would you do something like that..."<PG>
"Maybe I should head home soon. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and the others are coming today, I think."<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> going to try to find <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> too, I bet..."<PG>
"What's gotten into <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Even as a lie, something like that―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"............!? What? This sound...!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
